{
  "_readme": [
    "Items share the id space with blocks.json (same ids as index.html).",
    "type: tool | material | bucket | door.  toolType: pickaxe | axe | shovel | shears | null.",
    "breakSpeed is a multiplier on mining speed, 1 = bare hand. normal = blocks with no special tool, plant / wood / stone / dirt / leaf = blocks of that type (see blocks.json).",
    "Example: a Stone Pickaxe with stone: 4 mines a stone-type block 4x faster than a hand.",
    "maxStack is 1 for every item. places.blockId = the block placed when you use the item (doors, buckets).",
    "Hovering an item shows a tooltip window built from settings.tooltip."
  ],
  "settings": {
    "maxStackDefault": 1,
    "tooltip": {
      "showOnHover": true,
      "fields": [
        "name",
        "description",
        "type"
      ],
      "showBreakSpeeds": true,
      "delayMs": 150,
      "offsetPx": [
        14,
        14
      ]
    }
  },
  "breakSpeedKeys": [
    "normal",
    "plant",
    "wood",
    "stone",
    "dirt",
    "leaf"
  ],
